{%- comment -%}
  alc-wall-art — the top of the wall-art collection page (Decoratiuni Perete), in
  the house language of alc-company / alc-showroom:

  1. a dark gallery hero: copy on the left, three lifestyle photos of the artworks
     on the right (each one links to its product), and the white figures card over
     its foot (works, LED models, formats, starting price — all counted live)
  2. "On your wall": every format the collection has, drawn to scale above a
     220 cm sofa, 25 cm over the backrest; a format chip redraws the wall and
     shows the models in that format

  Formats come from the products' size metafields (custom.lungime = width,
  custom.inaltime = height, both lists in cm; three values = a set of three). A
  square "Diametru" product is drawn round.

  UI text is in the per-language dictionary below (en.default.json is at the key
  cap and T&A's automatic translation is off since August), so every market
  reads its own language. The product grid itself is the normal
  main-collection-product-grid section in the template.

  Styles: assets/alc-wall-art.css. The format switch is the small inline script
  after the wall, so the first drawing never flickers.
{%- endcomment -%}

{{ 'alc-wall-art.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign lang = request.locale.iso_code | downcase | slice: 0, 2

  comment
    d: eyebrow | heading (non-RO) | lead | see all | choose size | works | with LED |
       formats | starting price | sizes eyebrow | sizes title | sizes intro |
       set of 3 | sofa caption | sold out | drawn to scale | models in this format
  endcomment
  case lang
    when 'en'
      assign d = 'Wall gallery|Wall decor|LED-lit wall art and decorative compositions that give a bare wall character – at home, in the office or in a restaurant.|See all artworks|Choose the size|artworks in the collection|with LED lighting|different formats|starting price|On your wall|See the real size, not just the numbers.|Every format is drawn to scale above a 220 cm sofa, 25 cm over the backrest – the height a designer would hang it.|Set of 3|220 cm sofa · artwork 25 cm above the backrest|Sold out|Drawn to scale|Models in this format'
    when 'hu'
      assign d = 'Fali galéria|Falidekorációk|LED-es világítású falképek és dekoratív kompozíciók, amelyek karaktert adnak egy üres falnak – otthon, az irodában vagy az étteremben.|Az összes falkép|Válassz méretet|alkotás a kollekcióban|LED-világítással|különböző formátum|kezdőár|A te faladon|Lásd a valódi méretet, ne csak a számokat.|Minden formátum méretarányosan van megrajzolva egy 220 cm-es kanapé fölé, 25 cm-rel a háttámla fölött – ilyen magasra akasztaná egy belsőépítész.|3 darabos szett|220 cm-es kanapé · a kép 25 cm-rel a háttámla fölött|Elfogyott|Méretarányos rajz|Modellek ebben a formátumban'
    when 'pl'
      assign d = 'Galeria ścienna|Dekoracje ścienne|Obrazy z podświetleniem LED i kompozycje dekoracyjne, które nadają charakter pustej ścianie – w domu, w biurze lub w restauracji.|Zobacz wszystkie obrazy|Wybierz rozmiar|prac w kolekcji|z podświetleniem LED|różnych formatów|cena początkowa|Na Twojej ścianie|Zobacz prawdziwy rozmiar, nie tylko liczby.|Każdy format narysowano w skali nad sofą o długości 220 cm, 25 cm nad oparciem – na wysokości, na jakiej powiesiłby go projektant.|Zestaw 3 obrazów|Sofa 220 cm · obraz 25 cm nad oparciem|Wyprzedane|Rysunek w skali|Modele w tym formacie'
    when 'el'
      assign d = 'Γκαλερί τοίχου|Διακόσμηση τοίχου|Πίνακες με φωτισμό LED και διακοσμητικές συνθέσεις που δίνουν χαρακτήρα σε έναν άδειο τοίχο – στο σπίτι, στο γραφείο ή στο εστιατόριο.|Δείτε όλους τους πίνακες|Επιλέξτε μέγεθος|έργα στη συλλογή|με φωτισμό LED|διαφορετικά μεγέθη|τιμή από|Στον τοίχο σας|Δείτε το πραγματικό μέγεθος, όχι μόνο νούμερα.|Κάθε μέγεθος είναι σχεδιασμένο υπό κλίμακα πάνω από έναν καναπέ 220 cm, 25 cm πάνω από την πλάτη – στο ύψος που θα το κρεμούσε ένας διακοσμητής.|Σετ 3 τεμαχίων|Καναπές 220 cm · πίνακας 25 cm πάνω από την πλάτη|Εξαντλήθηκε|Σχέδιο υπό κλίμακα|Μοντέλα σε αυτό το μέγεθος'
    when 'bg'
      assign d = 'Стенна галерия|Декорация за стена|Картини с LED подсветка и декоративни композиции, които придават характер на празна стена – у дома, в офиса или в ресторанта.|Вижте всички картини|Изберете размер|творби в колекцията|с LED подсветка|различни формата|начална цена|На вашата стена|Вижте истинския размер, не само числата.|Всеки формат е нарисуван в мащаб над диван от 220 cm, на 25 cm над облегалката – на височината, на която би я окачил дизайнер.|Комплект от 3|Диван 220 cm · картината на 25 cm над облегалката|Изчерпан|Рисунка в мащаб|Модели в този формат'
    when 'it'
      assign d = 'Galleria da parete|Decorazioni da parete|Quadri con illuminazione LED e composizioni decorative che danno carattere a una parete vuota: a casa, in ufficio o al ristorante.|Vedi tutti i quadri|Scegli la misura|opere nella collezione|con illuminazione LED|formati diversi|prezzo di partenza|Sulla tua parete|Guarda la misura reale, non solo i numeri.|Ogni formato è disegnato in scala sopra un divano di 220 cm, a 25 cm dallo schienale: l’altezza a cui lo appenderebbe un designer.|Set da 3|Divano da 220 cm · quadro a 25 cm sopra lo schienale|Esaurito|Disegno in scala|Modelli in questo formato'
    when 'fr'
      assign d = 'Galerie murale|Décoration murale|Tableaux avec éclairage LED et compositions décoratives qui donnent du caractère à un mur nu – à la maison, au bureau ou au restaurant.|Voir tous les tableaux|Choisir la taille|œuvres dans la collection|avec éclairage LED|formats différents|prix de départ|Sur votre mur|Voyez la taille réelle, pas seulement les chiffres.|Chaque format est dessiné à l’échelle au-dessus d’un canapé de 220 cm, à 25 cm du dossier – la hauteur à laquelle un décorateur l’accrocherait.|Lot de 3|Canapé de 220 cm · tableau à 25 cm au-dessus du dossier|Épuisé|Dessin à l’échelle|Modèles dans ce format'
    when 'cs'
      assign d = 'Nástěnná galerie|Nástěnné dekorace|Obrazy s LED podsvícením a dekorativní kompozice, které dodají prázdné stěně charakter – doma, v kanceláři nebo v restauraci.|Zobrazit všechny obrazy|Vyberte velikost|děl v kolekci|s LED podsvícením|různých formátů|počáteční cena|Na vaší stěně|Podívejte se na skutečnou velikost, ne jen na čísla.|Každý formát je nakreslen v měřítku nad pohovkou o délce 220 cm, 25 cm nad opěradlem – ve výšce, kam by ho pověsil designér.|Sada 3 kusů|Pohovka 220 cm · obraz 25 cm nad opěradlem|Vyprodáno|Nákres v měřítku|Modely v tomto formátu'
    when 'sk'
      assign d = 'Nástenná galéria|Nástenné dekorácie|Obrazy s LED podsvietením a dekoratívne kompozície, ktoré dodajú prázdnej stene charakter – doma, v kancelárii alebo v reštaurácii.|Zobraziť všetky obrazy|Vyberte veľkosť|diel v kolekcii|s LED podsvietením|rôznych formátov|počiatočná cena|Na vašej stene|Pozrite si skutočnú veľkosť, nie iba čísla.|Každý formát je nakreslený v mierke nad pohovkou s dĺžkou 220 cm, 25 cm nad operadlom – vo výške, kam by ho zavesil dizajnér.|Sada 3 kusov|Pohovka 220 cm · obraz 25 cm nad operadlom|Vypredané|Nákres v mierke|Modely v tomto formáte'
    when 'hr'
      assign d = 'Zidna galerija|Zidne dekoracije|Slike s LED rasvjetom i dekorativne kompozicije koje praznom zidu daju karakter – kod kuće, u uredu ili u restoranu.|Pogledajte sve slike|Odaberite veličinu|djela u kolekciji|s LED rasvjetom|različitih formata|početna cijena|Na vašem zidu|Pogledajte stvarnu veličinu, ne samo brojeve.|Svaki je format nacrtan u mjerilu iznad kauča od 220 cm, 25 cm iznad naslona – na visini na koju bi ga objesio dizajner.|Set od 3|Kauč od 220 cm · slika 25 cm iznad naslona|Rasprodano|Crtež u mjerilu|Modeli u ovom formatu'
    when 'de'
      assign d = 'Wandgalerie|Wanddekoration|Wandbilder mit LED-Beleuchtung und dekorative Kompositionen, die einer leeren Wand Charakter geben – zu Hause, im Büro oder im Restaurant.|Alle Bilder ansehen|Größe wählen|Werke in der Kollektion|mit LED-Beleuchtung|verschiedene Formate|Einstiegspreis|An Ihrer Wand|Sehen Sie die echte Größe, nicht nur die Zahlen.|Jedes Format ist maßstabsgetreu über einem 220-cm-Sofa gezeichnet, 25 cm über der Rückenlehne – auf der Höhe, auf der es ein Designer aufhängen würde.|3er-Set|220-cm-Sofa · Bild 25 cm über der Rückenlehne|Ausverkauft|Maßstabsgetreue Zeichnung|Modelle in diesem Format'
    else
      assign d = 'Galerie de perete|Decorațiuni de perete|Tablouri cu iluminare LED și compoziții decorative care dau caracter unui perete gol – acasă, la birou sau în restaurant.|Vezi toate tablourile|Alege mărimea|lucrări în colecție|cu iluminare LED|formate diferite|prețul de pornire|Pe peretele tău|Vezi mărimea reală, nu doar cifrele.|Fiecare format e desenat la scară deasupra unei canapele de 220 cm, la 25 cm de spătar – înălțimea la care l-ar agăța un designer.|Set de 3|Canapea de 220 cm · tabloul la 25 cm deasupra spătarului|Stoc epuizat|Desen la scară|Modele în acest format'
  endcase
  assign t = d | split: '|'

  comment
    The collection title is not translated on the foreign markets yet, so they get
    the dictionary heading; Romania keeps the collection's own title.
  endcomment
  if lang == 'ro'
    assign heading = collection.title
  else
    assign heading = t[1]
  endif

  assign anchor_grid = s.grid_anchor | default: 'ProductGridContainer'
  assign sizes_id = 'alcwa-sizes-' | append: section.id

  comment
    One pass over the products (paginated, so the 50-product cap does not apply):
    live counts, the starting price, each product's format key, and the list of
    formats as "AREA|key|pieces|round" so a plain string sort orders them by size.
  endcomment
  assign works = 0
  assign led = 0
  assign min_price = 0
  assign fmt_rows = ''
  assign prod_keys = ''
-%}

{%- paginate collection.products by 250 -%}
  {%- for p in collection.products -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign works = works | plus: 1
      if p.metafields.custom.putere.value != blank or p.type contains 'LED'
        assign led = led | plus: 1
      endif
      if p.available
        if min_price == 0 or p.price < min_price
          assign min_price = p.price
        endif
      endif

      assign key = ''
      assign wl = p.metafields.custom.lungime.value
      assign hl = p.metafields.custom.inaltime.value
      if wl != blank and hl != blank and wl.size == hl.size
        assign pieces = ''
        assign area = 0
        for wv in wl
          assign w = wv | remove: 'cm' | strip | replace: ',', '.' | plus: 0
          assign h = hl[forloop.index0] | remove: 'cm' | strip | replace: ',', '.' | plus: 0
          assign area = w | times: h | plus: area
          if forloop.index > 1
            assign pieces = pieces | append: '-'
          endif
          assign pieces = pieces | append: w | append: 'x' | append: h
        endfor
        assign round = '0'
        if wl.size == 1 and w == h
          assign t_low = p.title | downcase
          assign h_low = p.handle | downcase
          if t_low contains 'diametru' or h_low contains 'diametru' or t_low contains 'ø'
            assign round = '1'
          endif
        endif
        if wl.size > 1
          assign key = 'set-' | append: pieces
        elsif round == '1'
          assign key = 'd' | append: w
        else
          assign key = pieces
        endif
        assign area_pad = '000000' | append: area | slice: -6, 6
        assign row = area_pad | append: '|' | append: key | append: '|' | append: pieces | append: '|' | append: round
        unless fmt_rows contains row
          assign fmt_rows = fmt_rows | append: row | append: ';'
        endunless
      endif
      assign prod_keys = prod_keys | append: key | append: ';'
    -%}
  {%- endfor -%}

  {%- liquid
    assign formats = fmt_rows | split: ';' | sort
    assign keys = prod_keys | split: ';'

    comment
      The format shown first: the one with the most models in stock.
    endcomment
    assign default_key = ''
    assign best = -1
    for row in formats
      assign parts = row | split: '|'
      assign fk = parts[1]
      assign n_av = 0
      for p in collection.products
        if p.available and keys[forloop.index0] == fk
          assign n_av = n_av | plus: 1
        endif
      endfor
      if n_av > best
        assign best = n_av
        assign default_key = fk
      endif
    endfor

    assign tiles = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'tile'
    assign reveal = ''
    if settings.animations_reveal_on_scroll
      assign reveal = ' scroll-trigger animate--slide-in'
    endif
    assign arrow = '<svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>'
  -%}

  <div class="alcwa" id="alcwa-{{ section.id }}">
    {%- comment -%} ------------------------------------------------ HERO {%- endcomment -%}
    <section class="alcwa__hero">
      <div class="page-width alcwa__hero-inner">
        <div class="alcwa__hero-copy">
          <p class="alcwa__eyebrow alcwa__eyebrow--gold">{{ t[0] }}</p>
          <h1 class="alcwa__hero-title">{% render 'alc-nbsp', text: heading %}</h1>
          <p class="alcwa__hero-lead">{{ t[2] | replace: ' – ', '&nbsp;– ' }}</p>
          <div class="alcwa__actions">
            <a class="alcwa__btn alcwa__btn--light" href="#{{ anchor_grid }}">
              {{- t[3] -}}
              {{- arrow -}}
            </a>
            {%- if s.show_sizes and formats.size > 1 -%}
              <a class="alcwa__btn alcwa__btn--glass" href="#{{ sizes_id }}">
                <svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 8V4h4M21 8V4h-4M3 16v4h4M21 16v4h-4"/></svg>
                {{- t[4] -}}
              </a>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="alcwa__mosaic">
          {%- liquid
            comment
              Three photos: the tile blocks, or the first three products when there are none.
            endcomment
            assign shown = 0
          -%}
          {%- if tiles.size > 0 -%}
            {%- for block in tiles limit: 3 -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign tp = block.settings.product
                if tp == blank
                  continue
                endif
                assign mi = block.settings.media_position | minus: 1
                assign media = tp.media[mi] | default: tp.featured_media
                assign shown = shown | plus: 1
              -%}
              {%- render 'alc-wa-tile', product: tp, media: media, index: shown, block: block -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          {%- else -%}
            {%- for tp in collection.products limit: 3 -%}
              {%- assign shown = shown | plus: 1 -%}
              {%- render 'alc-wa-tile', product: tp, media: tp.featured_media, index: shown -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="page-width">
      <dl class="alcwa__stats">
        <div class="alcwa__stat">
          <dt>{{ t[5] }}</dt>
          <dd>{{ works }}</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="alcwa__stat">
          <dt>{{ t[6] }}</dt>
          <dd>{{ led }}</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="alcwa__stat">
          <dt>{{ t[7] }}</dt>
          <dd>{{ formats.size }}</dd>
        </div>
        {%- if min_price > 0 -%}
          <div class="alcwa__stat">
            <dt>{{ t[8] }}</dt>
            <dd>{{ min_price | money }}</dd>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </dl>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} ----------------------------------------------- SIZES {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if s.show_sizes and formats.size > 1 -%}
      <section class="page-width alcwa__sizes{{ reveal }}" id="{{ sizes_id }}" data-alcwa-sizes>
        <div class="alcwa__sizes-grid">
          <div class="alcwa__sizes-head">
            <p class="alcwa__eyebrow">{{ t[9] }}</p>
            <h2 class="alcwa__title">{% render 'alc-nbsp', text: t[10] %}</h2>
            <p class="alcwa__intro">{{ t[11] | replace: ' – ', '&nbsp;– ' | replace: ' cm', '&nbsp;cm' }}</p>

            <div class="alcwa__chips" role="group" aria-label="{{ t[4] | escape }}">
              {%- for row in formats -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign parts = row | split: '|'
                  assign fk = parts[1]
                  assign fpieces = parts[2]
                  assign fround = parts[3]
                  assign n = 0
                  for k in keys
                    if k == fk
                      assign n = n | plus: 1
                    endif
                  endfor
                  if fround == '1'
                    assign dia = fpieces | split: 'x' | first
                    assign label = 'Ø ' | append: dia | append: ' cm'
                  elsif fk contains 'set-'
                    assign label = t[12]
                  else
                    assign label = fpieces | replace: 'x', ' × ' | append: ' cm'
                  endif
                -%}
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="alcwa__chip"
                  data-key="{{ fk }}"
                  data-pieces="{{ fpieces }}"
                  data-round="{{ fround }}"
                  aria-pressed="{% if fk == default_key %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
                >
                  <span class="alcwa__chip-shape alcwa__chip-shape--{% if fround == '1' %}round{% elsif fk contains 'set-' %}set{% else %}rect{% endif %}" aria-hidden="true"
                    {%- unless fround == '1' or fk contains 'set-' -%}
                      {%- assign cw = fpieces | split: 'x' | first | plus: 0 -%}
                      {%- assign ch = fpieces | split: 'x' | last | plus: 0 -%}
                      {%- if cw > ch %} data-wide{% endif -%}
                    {%- endunless -%}
                  ></span>
                  <span>{{ label }}</span>
                  <span class="alcwa__chip-count">{{ n }}</span>
                </button>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
          </div>

          <figure class="alcwa__wall">
            <div class="alcwa__scene" data-alcwa-scene role="img" aria-label="{{ t[15] | escape }}">
              <div class="alcwa__ruler" aria-hidden="true">
                {%- for cm in (1..5) -%}
                  {%- assign y = cm | times: 50 -%}
                  <span style="bottom: {{ y | times: 100.0 | divided_by: 250 }}%"><i>{{ y }}</i></span>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
              <div class="alcwa__piece" data-piece="0"></div>
              <div class="alcwa__piece" data-piece="1"></div>
              <div class="alcwa__piece" data-piece="2"></div>
              <div class="alcwa__dim alcwa__dim--w" data-dim-w><span data-dim-w-label></span></div>
              <div class="alcwa__dim alcwa__dim--h" data-dim-h><span data-dim-h-label></span></div>
              <svg class="alcwa__sofa" viewBox="0 0 220 85" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <rect x="12" y="2" width="196" height="46" rx="10" fill="#cfc7bb"/>
                <rect x="24" y="8" width="84" height="38" rx="9" fill="#d8d1c6"/>
                <rect x="112" y="8" width="84" height="38" rx="9" fill="#d8d1c6"/>
                <rect x="0" y="30" width="24" height="48" rx="10" fill="#d2cabe"/>
                <rect x="196" y="30" width="24" height="48" rx="10" fill="#d2cabe"/>
                <rect x="16" y="44" width="188" height="34" rx="8" fill="#ddd6cb"/>
                <rect x="24" y="44" width="85" height="16" rx="6" fill="#e6e0d6"/>
                <rect x="111" y="44" width="85" height="16" rx="6" fill="#e6e0d6"/>
                <rect x="18" y="78" width="5" height="7" rx="1.5" fill="#8f877c"/>
                <rect x="197" y="78" width="5" height="7" rx="1.5" fill="#8f877c"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <figcaption class="alcwa__caption">
              <span>{{ t[13] }}</span>
              <span class="alcwa__caption-tag">{{ t[15] }}</span>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <div class="alcwa__strip-wrap">
          <div class="alcwa__strip-head">
            <p class="alcwa__strip-title">{{ t[16] }}</p>
            <div class="alcwa__strip-nav">
              <button type="button" class="alcwa__nav" data-alcwa-prev aria-label="{{ 'general.slider.previous_slide' | t | escape }}" disabled>
                <svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M19 12H5M11 6l-6 6 6 6"/></svg>
              </button>
              <button type="button" class="alcwa__nav" data-alcwa-next aria-label="{{ 'general.slider.next_slide' | t | escape }}">
                <svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="alcwa__strip" role="list" data-alcwa-strip>
            {%- comment -%} In-stock models first, sold-out ones last. {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- for pass in (1..2) -%}
              {%- for p in collection.products -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign k = keys[forloop.index0]
                  if k == blank
                    continue
                  endif
                  if pass == 1 and p.available == false
                    continue
                  endif
                  if pass == 2 and p.available
                    continue
                  endif
                -%}
                <li class="alcwa__card{% unless p.available %} is-soldout{% endunless %}" data-key="{{ k }}"{% if k != default_key %} hidden{% endif %}>
                  <a href="{{ p.url }}" class="alcwa__card-link">
                    <span class="alcwa__card-media">
                      {%- if p.featured_media -%}
                        {{
                          p.featured_media
                          | image_url: width: 600
                          | image_tag:
                            loading: 'lazy',
                            widths: '200,300,400,600',
                            sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 220px, 44vw',
                            alt: p.featured_media.alt
                        }}
                      {%- endif -%}
                      {%- if p.metafields.custom.putere.value != blank -%}
                        <span class="alcwa__card-tag">LED {{ p.metafields.custom.putere.value | first }}</span>
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </span>
                    <span class="alcwa__card-name">{% render 'alc-wa-name', title: p.title %}</span>
                    <span class="alcwa__card-meta">
                      {%- if p.available -%}
                        {%- if p.compare_at_price > p.price -%}
                          <span class="alcwa__card-sale">{{ p.price | money }}</span>
                          <s>{{ p.compare_at_price | money }}</s>
                        {%- else -%}
                          <span>{{ p.price | money }}</span>
                        {%- endif -%}
                      {%- else -%}
                        <span class="alcwa__card-out">{{ t[14] }}</span>
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </span>
                  </a>
                </li>
              {%- endfor -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <script>
        (function () {
          var root = document.getElementById('{{ sizes_id }}');
          if (!root) return;
          // The wall in cm: 380 wide, 300 high; the art hangs 25 cm above an 85 cm backrest.
          var WALL_W = 380, WALL_H = 300, BOTTOM = 110, GAP = 6;
          var scene = root.querySelector('[data-alcwa-scene]');
          var pieces = scene.querySelectorAll('.alcwa__piece');
          var dimW = scene.querySelector('[data-dim-w]'), dimWl = scene.querySelector('[data-dim-w-label]');
          var dimH = scene.querySelector('[data-dim-h]'), dimHl = scene.querySelector('[data-dim-h-label]');
          var cards = root.querySelectorAll('.alcwa__card');
          var chips = root.querySelectorAll('.alcwa__chip');
          var pct = function (v, of) { return (v / of * 100).toFixed(3) + '%'; };

          function draw(chip) {
            var list = chip.getAttribute('data-pieces').split('-').map(function (p) {
              var a = p.split('x'); return { w: +a[0], h: +a[1] };
            });
            var round = chip.getAttribute('data-round') === '1';
            var total = list.reduce(function (s, p) { return s + p.w; }, 0) + GAP * (list.length - 1);
            var maxH = Math.max.apply(null, list.map(function (p) { return p.h; }));
            var x = (WALL_W - total) / 2;
            pieces.forEach(function (el, i) {
              var p = list[i];
              if (p) {
                // A set hangs centred on one line.
                var b = BOTTOM + (maxH - p.h) / 2;
                el.style.left = pct(x, WALL_W);
                el.style.width = pct(p.w, WALL_W);
                el.style.bottom = pct(b, WALL_H);
                el.style.height = pct(p.h, WALL_H);
                el.style.opacity = '1';
                x += p.w + GAP;
              } else {
                el.style.left = pct(WALL_W / 2, WALL_W);
                el.style.width = '0%';
                el.style.opacity = '0';
              }
              el.classList.toggle('is-round', round && i === 0);
            });
            var left = (WALL_W - total) / 2;
            dimW.style.left = pct(left, WALL_W);
            dimW.style.width = pct(total, WALL_W);
            dimW.style.bottom = pct(BOTTOM + maxH + 7, WALL_H);
            dimWl.textContent = round ? 'Ø ' + list[0].w + ' cm' : list.map(function (p) { return p.w; }).join(' + ') + ' cm';
            dimH.style.left = pct(left + total + 7, WALL_W);
            dimH.style.bottom = pct(BOTTOM, WALL_H);
            dimH.style.height = pct(maxH, WALL_H);
            dimH.style.opacity = round ? '0' : '1';
            dimHl.textContent = maxH + ' cm';
            scene.setAttribute('aria-label', scene.getAttribute('data-label-base') + ': ' + dimWl.textContent + (round ? '' : ' × ' + maxH + ' cm'));
          }

          function select(chip) {
            var key = chip.getAttribute('data-key');
            chips.forEach(function (c) { c.setAttribute('aria-pressed', c === chip ? 'true' : 'false'); });
            cards.forEach(function (c) { c.hidden = c.getAttribute('data-key') !== key; });
            var strip = root.querySelector('[data-alcwa-strip]');
            if (strip) strip.scrollLeft = 0;
            draw(chip);
            nav();
          }

          // Arrows for the models row: a page at a time, disabled at either end.
          var strip = root.querySelector('[data-alcwa-strip]');
          var prev = root.querySelector('[data-alcwa-prev]'), next = root.querySelector('[data-alcwa-next]');
          function nav() {
            if (!strip || !prev) return;
            var max = strip.scrollWidth - strip.clientWidth;
            prev.disabled = strip.scrollLeft <= 2;
            next.disabled = strip.scrollLeft >= max - 2;
            prev.parentNode.hidden = max <= 2;
          }
          if (strip && prev) {
            var page = function (dir) {
              var rtl = getComputedStyle(strip).direction === 'rtl' ? -1 : 1;
              strip.scrollBy({ left: dir * rtl * strip.clientWidth, behavior: 'smooth' });
            };
            prev.addEventListener('click', function () { page(-1); });
            next.addEventListener('click', function () { page(1); });
            strip.addEventListener('scroll', nav, { passive: true });
            window.addEventListener('resize', nav, { passive: true });
          }

          scene.setAttribute('data-label-base', scene.getAttribute('aria-label'));
          scene.classList.add('is-instant');
          var first = root.querySelector('.alcwa__chip[aria-pressed="true"]') || chips[0];
          if (first) draw(first);
          nav();
          requestAnimationFrame(function () { requestAnimationFrame(function () { scene.classList.remove('is-instant'); }); });
          chips.forEach(function (c) { c.addEventListener('click', function () { select(c); }); });
        })();
      </script>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endpaginate -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "ALC - Wall art top",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Top of the wall-art collection page: dark gallery hero with three photos, live figures and the to-scale size chooser. Text is translated in the section's own dictionary."
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_sizes",
      "label": "Show the size chooser",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "grid_anchor",
      "label": "Product grid anchor id",
      "default": "ProductGridContainer"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "tile",
      "name": "Hero photo",
      "limit": 3,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "product",
          "id": "product",
          "label": "Product"
        },
        {
          "type": "range",
          "id": "media_position",
          "label": "Photo number in the product gallery",
          "min": 1,
          "max": 12,
          "step": 1,
          "default": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "focus",
          "label": "Crop focus",
          "default": "center",
          "options": [
            { "value": "top", "label": "Top" },
            { "value": "center", "label": "Center" },
            { "value": "bottom", "label": "Bottom" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "ALC - Wall art top"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
